## Test Patterns for Future Reference

### Component Testing Pattern
```typescript
beforeEach(async () => {
  await TestBed.configureTestingModule({
    imports: [YourComponent, Dependencies],
  }).compileComponents();
  fixture = TestBed.createComponent(YourComponent);
});
```

### Signal Testing Pattern
```typescript
it('should have signal defined', () => {
  expect(component.mySignal()).toBe(expectedValue);
});
```

### Template Testing Pattern
```typescript
fixture.detectChanges();
const element = fixture.debugElement.nativeElement.querySelector('selector');
expect(element.textContent).toContain('expected');
```

All test files follow Vitest naming conventions (*.spec.ts) and are co-located with their source files for easy maintenance.
